WEBVTT

00:00:17.292 --> 00:00:20.000
So we still don't know what happened to Jin?

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.083
We haven't obtained any
solid information on that yet.

00:00:22.083 --> 00:00:25.375
But I firmly believe that he's okay.

00:00:25.375 --> 00:00:28.625
Jin is the last child who was born on Altair.

00:00:28.625 --> 00:00:31.167
We cannot lose him so easily.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.667
In any case...

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:38.125
...considering the battle data
that was sent from Vega...

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:40.583
...Mykage might be right.

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:42.625
What do you mean?

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:46.083
I mean that the "strongest
Rare Igura" that we seek...

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:50.000
...is highly likely to be
near the Mechanical Angel.

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:56.042
This is nonsense!

00:00:56.042 --> 00:00:59.000
So we couldn't get permission to deploy?

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.250
I was told not to take action until
we know what happened to Sir Jin.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.833
We can't wait any longer!

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:05.750
Even if no one else is going, we'll head to Vega!

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.250
Yeah!

00:01:08.917 --> 00:01:11.500
How beautiful...

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.792
I just became a tad jealous of Jin.

00:01:14.792 --> 00:01:19.333
It seems he endears himself to his
subordinates more than I thought.

00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:20.833
Who are you?!

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:27.958
May hope be with the
warriors with high morale.

00:01:36.542 --> 00:01:38.042
<i>Osore!</i>

00:01:38.042 --> 00:01:42.083
<i>Living your life don't give up now</i>
<i>keep moving on</i>

00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:47.708
<i>Kimi o dakishimeru</i>
<i>nando mo nando mo nando mo</i>

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:53.583
<i>Ashita boku wa kimi ni deau darou</i>

00:01:53.583 --> 00:01:59.292
<i>Wazuka na hoshi akari o tayori ni</i>

00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:05.375
<i>Boku ni wa kimi ga wakaru yo wakaru yo</i>

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:15.292
<i>Sen oku no toki o koe </i>
<i>futari hiraku densetsu no tobira</i>

00:02:15.292 --> 00:02:21.167
<i>Naraku no ao tobikoete</i>

00:02:21.167 --> 00:02:26.958
<i>Kimi to hai ni naru tame</i>

00:02:26.958 --> 00:02:37.917
<i>Nagaki rinne o</i>
<i>kanashimi tsurete tabi shite kitanda</i>

00:02:37.917 --> 00:02:40.958
<i>Zenryoku de mikansei</i>

00:02:40.958 --> 00:02:43.833
<i>Kimi no tonari de</i>

00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:49.625
<i>Kawaita kokoro hodoke chi o nagasu kedo</i>

00:02:49.625 --> 00:02:52.667
<i>Soba ni iru yo zutto</i>

00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:55.542
<i>Yorisotte zutto</i>

00:02:55.542 --> 00:03:00.208
<i>Futari hikari no fune ni noru</i>

00:03:00.208 --> 00:03:06.000
<i>Kaze no hajimari no oto kanadeyou (Mezame!)</i>

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.208
My holes...

00:03:13.208 --> 00:03:16.458
They've been filled again.

00:03:16.458 --> 00:03:16.833
I wonder if the same person filled them all.

00:03:16.833 --> 00:03:18.958
"Anagram of Man and Woman"

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:21.250
"Anagram of Man and Woman"
How persistent...

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:26.625
I swear I'll find out who's doing this
and make a big hole in her closed heart!

00:03:26.625 --> 00:03:31.250
--Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!...
--Like I said... there's no guarantee that it's a girl, you know...

00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:41.083
Special report! Luxurious restaurants
with a beautiful night view!

00:03:41.083 --> 00:03:43.167
Planning for a date, Sazanka?

00:03:43.167 --> 00:03:44.750
No...

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:49.333
If Shrade and Cayenne are
together in places like these...

00:03:49.333 --> 00:03:51.792
What? What about Cayenne?

00:03:51.792 --> 00:03:53.250
Oh, nothing!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.542
You see, I don't have a partner like you, so...!

00:03:56.542 --> 00:03:58.000
Partner?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.792
Amata.

00:03:59.792 --> 00:04:02.250
Amata and I aren't like that!

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:04.125
Then can I have him?

00:04:04.125 --> 00:04:05.625
What?

00:04:07.792 --> 00:04:11.500
I had no idea there were this many
hole-in-the-wall spots in Kowloon!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:12.833
How impure!

00:04:12.833 --> 00:04:17.250
That's something that vulgar guys who
plainly have ulterior motives would read!

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.042
--What?
--Hole-in-the-wall, you say?!

00:04:20.042 --> 00:04:23.208
Don't read such vulgar stuff
in front of me ever again!

00:04:25.792 --> 00:04:29.542
Did I say something wrong?

00:04:29.542 --> 00:04:30.667
I see...

00:04:30.667 --> 00:04:32.167
What?

00:04:33.375 --> 00:04:37.125
So you couldn't find anything
in the Abductor's wreckage?

00:04:37.125 --> 00:04:41.042
Right, although there's no doubt
that there was a pilot in it.

00:04:41.042 --> 00:04:43.125
I'm having them continue the investigation.

00:04:43.125 --> 00:04:47.500
Ah! Don't take that chocolate donut.
I'm going to eat it.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.333
Oh, pardon me.

00:04:51.458 --> 00:04:54.458
This must be Shrade.

00:04:54.458 --> 00:04:57.417
The sounds have grown more brilliant...

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:04.000
...even though the darkness in his heart
must be continuing to expand...

00:05:17.333 --> 00:05:18.833
Why don't you come in?

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.958
You want to talk to me about something?

00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:27.500
You don't have to hold back.

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:31.292
We can't find the pilot who was
in the Abductor we defeated.

00:05:31.292 --> 00:05:33.208
Do you sense something?

00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:36.167
Unfortunately, nothing really.

00:05:36.167 --> 00:05:39.958
But I like it when you turn to me for help.

00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:44.125
Use your power only to distinguish sounds.

00:05:44.125 --> 00:05:46.125
Don't go out to the battlefield again.

00:05:46.125 --> 00:05:47.875
Are you concerned about me?

00:05:47.875 --> 00:05:52.375
It's a bother to have to team up with
someone who wants to rush to his death.

00:05:52.375 --> 00:05:56.625
You seem irritated because the
visions you have are all ominous.

00:05:56.625 --> 00:06:01.625
If you're like that, you may be deaf
to the sounds of your sister's heart.

00:06:01.625 --> 00:06:03.250
Mikono's?

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:06.042
Those are interesting sounds.

00:06:06.042 --> 00:06:08.833
They spread amicably.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:23.458
Why are you still digging holes
when the Berlin Wall is already gone?

00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:25.958
Because digging is my life.

00:06:25.958 --> 00:06:28.458
If I stop digging, I'll die.

00:06:28.458 --> 00:06:30.417
That's like sharks.

00:06:30.417 --> 00:06:33.917
But what meanings do holes have?

00:06:33.917 --> 00:06:37.417
Beyond the holes, there are unknown worlds.

00:06:40.125 --> 00:06:42.417
When a tunnel passes through a mountain,

00:06:42.417 --> 00:06:46.792
lands and cultures unknown to each
other meet and the world expands.

00:06:46.792 --> 00:06:48.625
If you dig a well and water bubbles out,

00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:52.542
people gather there and their lives become rich.

00:06:52.542 --> 00:06:55.792
That's how mankind has advanced over time.

00:06:55.792 --> 00:07:00.625
You're amazing, Andy! So your reasons
for digging holes are that deep?

00:07:00.625 --> 00:07:04.458
So what kind of new world
will this hole lead us to?

00:07:04.458 --> 00:07:06.583
The main bathing room in the girls' dorm.

00:07:06.583 --> 00:07:09.458
--What?
--Oh, no!

00:07:09.458 --> 00:07:13.042
Th-That really is an unknown world, but...

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:33.042
So it was you...

00:07:33.042 --> 00:07:35.000
So it was you...!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.667
Of all people...

00:07:37.667 --> 00:07:40.583
But this might be fate, too.

00:07:43.042 --> 00:07:45.958
We have totally opposite powers.

00:07:45.958 --> 00:07:47.708
The source of attraction is a black hole!

00:07:47.708 --> 00:07:50.750
--Huh?!
--A big bang that's almost bursting out!

00:07:53.167 --> 00:07:55.417
Y-You make no sense!
What're you talking about?!

00:07:55.417 --> 00:07:58.375
Hey, do you know what you're doing?!

00:07:58.375 --> 00:07:59.750
Of course!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.500
I'm digging holes... for you!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.500
What? For me?

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.792
That's right! In order for
you and me to be connected!

00:08:10.208 --> 00:08:14.042
Stay at least one meter away
from me! I'll catch your impurity!

00:08:14.042 --> 00:08:16.875
--What?!
--Why do you dig holes?!

00:08:16.875 --> 00:08:18.583
Put yourself in the shoes
of the person who fills them!

00:08:18.583 --> 00:08:23.583
I didn't ask you to fill them!
They are my precious, precious holes!

00:08:23.583 --> 00:08:26.417
A guy with a love of holes is disgusting!

00:08:26.417 --> 00:08:29.375
Get out of my sight! Now!

00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:33.792
Why don't you just fall into one of
those garbage dump-like holes of yours?!

00:08:33.792 --> 00:08:38.542
How rude! You insulted my holes... My life!

00:08:38.542 --> 00:08:43.000
E-Excuse me... but could you
stop fighting and help me?

00:08:50.667 --> 00:08:55.708
Andy and Mix?
That’s quite a long shot of a pair.

00:08:55.708 --> 00:08:58.333
What's your intention?

00:08:58.333 --> 00:08:59.542
Holes.

00:08:59.542 --> 00:09:00.792
Holes?

00:09:00.792 --> 00:09:03.917
There are many proverbs
that are related to holes.

00:09:03.917 --> 00:09:06.750
"The fox does not prey near his hole."

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:09.167
"Better a patch than a hole."

00:09:09.167 --> 00:09:11.250
"Daylight will peep through a small hole."

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.875
"Dumplings are better than holes."

00:09:12.875 --> 00:09:14.375
Hey, hey...

00:09:14.375 --> 00:09:20.125
So, holes are given various
meanings in various situations.

00:09:20.125 --> 00:09:23.042
What is the reason for adding Mikono there?

00:09:23.042 --> 00:09:26.292
Her Element power is unknown.

00:09:26.292 --> 00:09:29.625
"A donut is an empty space
surrounded by a ring."

00:09:29.625 --> 00:09:31.458
Fudo, you said that Mikono

00:09:31.458 --> 00:09:35.125
is the ring that makes a donut
out of that empty space.

00:09:35.125 --> 00:09:37.875
Empty space isn't emptiness.

00:09:37.875 --> 00:09:42.208
By including everything
and not precluding anything,

00:09:42.208 --> 00:09:47.167
what meanings can they bring to the holes?

00:09:48.583 --> 00:09:50.708
Why me?

00:09:50.708 --> 00:09:54.542
Unlike everyone else,
I don't have special powers...

00:09:54.542 --> 00:09:58.542
But you were able to fight fine
in a real battle the other day.

00:09:58.542 --> 00:10:00.292
I'm sure Supreme Commander
Fudo and the instructors

00:10:00.292 --> 00:10:02.125
have thought through
the reasons for doing this.

00:10:02.125 --> 00:10:04.542
No! Definitely not!

00:10:04.542 --> 00:10:06.292
--Hey...
--Mix!

00:10:06.292 --> 00:10:08.208
There's no way I'd merge with a guy like him!

00:10:08.208 --> 00:10:10.458
Just give it up, Mix.

00:10:10.458 --> 00:10:13.667
Everyone has their first time.

00:10:13.667 --> 00:10:18.333
You shouldn't feel embarrassed. You shouldn't...

00:10:18.333 --> 00:10:23.542
If I have to merge with him,
I'd rather merge with a green cat!

00:10:23.542 --> 00:10:27.000
No! This is a nightmare!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:31.417
Why are you refusing it?! This is
the Gattai you've been dreaming of!

00:10:32.542 --> 00:10:36.542
--L-Let go of me!
--It doesn't look to me like they've thought this through.

00:10:41.125 --> 00:10:42.875
Andy! Mix!

00:10:42.875 --> 00:10:44.208
L-Let's merge.

00:10:44.208 --> 00:10:45.500
Let me off!

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:49.000
I don't wanna merge with a crude,
hole-obsessed creature like him!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.833
Don't be ridiculous! Apologize to holes!

00:10:50.833 --> 00:10:52.667
Shut up! Your brain is full of holes!

00:10:52.667 --> 00:10:54.333
--What'd you say?!
--Shut up! Don't talk to me!

00:10:54.333 --> 00:10:56.875
B-Both of you, calm down.

00:10:59.542 --> 00:11:01.750
The simulation will be interrupted!

00:11:03.667 --> 00:11:09.167
Impossible! There's no way
we can get those two to merge!

00:11:29.042 --> 00:11:32.208
Seriously, why do I have to make holes?

00:11:32.208 --> 00:11:36.750
We have no choice! This is a
penalty for us refusing to merge.

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:40.417
It's the instructors' fault for coming
up with such a terrible combination.

00:11:40.417 --> 00:11:41.542
It's not my fault!

00:11:41.542 --> 00:11:44.417
I've got complaints, too! To start with--

00:11:44.417 --> 00:11:47.250
That's enough! Don't say another word!

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:51.625
It's my bad luck that I got paired
up with a guy who likes holes.

00:11:51.625 --> 00:11:53.417
Hey...

00:11:53.417 --> 00:11:57.125
Holes and guys... Which do you hate?!

00:11:57.125 --> 00:12:00.375
I don't like either! I hate both holes and guys!

00:12:00.375 --> 00:12:03.917
If there were no guys, you wouldn't
have been born, you know.

00:12:03.917 --> 00:12:06.292
Do you deny your own old man, too?!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.792
A guy like that...

00:12:22.833 --> 00:12:25.625
You don't have to feel down, you know.

00:12:25.625 --> 00:12:29.000
But if I had done better...

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:33.167
No one can get those two to work together.

00:12:33.167 --> 00:12:37.750
At any rate, I wonder why
Mix hates guys so much.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:40.625
Well, I heard this from Zessica, but...

00:12:40.625 --> 00:12:42.125
What?

00:12:43.917 --> 00:12:47.500
A writer for magazines? Mix's dad is?

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:51.875
He was interviewing people for a
magazine that introduces tourist sites.

00:12:51.875 --> 00:12:54.792
And then, he fell in love with a woman

00:12:54.792 --> 00:12:58.000
he came to know at a
hole-in-the-wall hot spring, and...

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:02.042
I see... That's why she hates holes, too, huh?

00:13:02.042 --> 00:13:05.458
But everyone has wounds in their heart.

00:13:05.458 --> 00:13:09.333
I think people need to fill the
holes in their hearts themselves.

00:13:09.333 --> 00:13:11.500
That might be true, but...

00:13:20.958 --> 00:13:25.042
She had a big hole in her heart from the start.

00:13:25.042 --> 00:13:27.125
She wanted to fill it, and that's why she...

00:13:28.417 --> 00:13:30.667
Ow! Ow, ow, ow...

00:13:30.667 --> 00:13:33.208
Who the hell dug a hole in a place like this?!

00:13:33.208 --> 00:13:36.250
Oh... It was me.

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:55.417
Damn Mechanical Angel! We'll avenge Sir Jin!

00:13:56.417 --> 00:13:58.417
Mykage, you...

00:13:58.417 --> 00:14:01.208
You must've manipulated their minds.

00:14:01.208 --> 00:14:04.083
Don't put it like that.

00:14:04.083 --> 00:14:07.875
All I did was give them a little...

00:14:07.875 --> 00:14:10.917
A little what?

00:14:10.917 --> 00:14:12.542
Dream.

00:14:12.542 --> 00:14:14.708
What are you after?

00:14:14.708 --> 00:14:18.875
Are you trying to get the
"true Eve" all to yourself?

00:14:18.875 --> 00:14:22.542
If everyone is to love the same flower,

00:14:22.542 --> 00:14:26.042
the point of flowers each blooming
in their own way is lost, right?

00:14:26.042 --> 00:14:27.333
Abductors have appeared!

00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:30.583
Elements are expected to take up Class II
Interception Positions immediately!

00:14:30.583 --> 00:14:32.542
I repeat! Elements are expected

00:14:32.542 --> 00:14:35.500
to take up Class II
Interception Positions immediately!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:38.042
Watching how the Abductors
have been acting lately,

00:14:38.042 --> 00:14:41.833
it seems that their purpose has changed.

00:14:41.833 --> 00:14:45.333
Their appearance has also been
focused in the Neo Kowloon area.

00:14:45.333 --> 00:14:49.542
Our enemy is three machines.
Let's send a sound team.

00:14:49.542 --> 00:14:53.500
Move out! The head will be Andy W. Hall.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.333
Roger...! What?!

00:14:55.333 --> 00:14:56.917
All right!

00:14:56.917 --> 00:14:59.167
The other two will be Mix and Mikono!

00:14:59.167 --> 00:15:01.083
What?!

00:15:01.083 --> 00:15:03.250
Please wait! I don't want to merge with a guy!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.083
Mix!

00:15:05.083 --> 00:15:09.167
This is a real battle!
This is no time to be selfish!

00:15:13.125 --> 00:15:15.250
Mikono, good luck.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.125
Vector X is now taking off!

00:15:25.708 --> 00:15:27.792
Vector Y is now taking off!

00:15:29.292 --> 00:15:31.458
Vector Z is now taking off!

00:15:38.625 --> 00:15:40.750
The day has finally come!

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.792
Now, let's get fired up and merge!

00:15:42.792 --> 00:15:44.125
--No!
--What?!

00:15:44.125 --> 00:15:47.792
I can't do it after all! I can't merge with a guy!

00:15:47.792 --> 00:15:49.042
Mix!

00:15:49.042 --> 00:15:51.708
Enemies like them... I'll defeat them alone!

00:15:56.667 --> 00:15:58.167
You jerk!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.750
Shoot!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.667
Mix!

00:16:16.667 --> 00:16:17.667
Andy?!

00:16:17.667 --> 00:16:19.333
Enough already!

00:16:19.333 --> 00:16:22.500
I won't deny your desire
to fill the hole in your heart!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:28.042
But all you're doing is rejecting
anything related to guys from the start!

00:16:28.042 --> 00:16:31.083
That's like... That's like...

00:16:33.792 --> 00:16:37.333
That's right! You're just like a pitfall!

00:16:37.333 --> 00:16:38.625
What do you mean by that?!

00:16:38.625 --> 00:16:43.125
I'm saying, all you're doing is covering
the surface without filling the hole!

00:16:43.125 --> 00:16:46.708
If you do that, mud will never come in!

00:16:46.708 --> 00:16:51.083
If you really want to fill the hole,
open it first before you close it!

00:16:51.083 --> 00:16:55.125
I'll fill the hole in your heart with my heart!

00:16:55.125 --> 00:16:56.750
Listen, Mix!

00:16:56.750 --> 00:17:01.792
My first Gattai with both gender
machines has to be with you!

00:17:03.083 --> 00:17:04.708
Andy...

00:17:04.708 --> 00:17:08.833
Let's merge, Mix. Have faith in Andy.

00:17:08.833 --> 00:17:11.333
All the Elements' aura levels are increasing!

00:17:11.333 --> 00:17:14.583
80... 85... They're rapidly increasing.

00:17:20.208 --> 00:17:24.042
Can the hole in my heart really be filled?

00:17:24.042 --> 00:17:25.750
Let's go, Mix! Mikono!

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.917
Roger!

00:17:27.917 --> 00:17:29.500
Roger.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:34.250
Big bang Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:46.917
No way...! What's this? It's completely
different from the Gattai with girls!

00:17:46.917 --> 00:17:50.333
Oh, no... Even my heart is throbbing so hard...

00:17:50.333 --> 00:17:52.542
I'm getting connected! I'm reaching there!

00:17:52.542 --> 00:17:56.042
The unknown world is spreading out before me!

00:17:56.042 --> 00:17:58.042
We won't let you!

00:18:01.375 --> 00:18:03.667
Mix?! Watch out!

00:18:07.125 --> 00:18:08.625
Andy!

00:18:12.292 --> 00:18:14.083
--Andy!
--Fudo!

00:18:14.083 --> 00:18:17.167
Element change! Amata Sora!

00:18:17.167 --> 00:18:18.667
Roger.

00:18:27.542 --> 00:18:30.000
--Andy!
--Get a grip, Andy!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.583
He protected me...

00:18:31.583 --> 00:18:34.250
Let's merge already, Mix!

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.542
What?! With you?!

00:18:35.542 --> 00:18:38.208
Why're you sort of disappointed?

00:18:38.208 --> 00:18:41.667
Mix! Don't waste Andy's consideration!

00:18:41.667 --> 00:18:44.833
Feel the remnants of Andy's heart!

00:18:44.833 --> 00:18:48.500
I know it'll fill the hole in your heart!

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.000
Mikono...

00:18:52.958 --> 00:18:54.208
Okay!

00:18:54.208 --> 00:18:59.000
Big bang Gattai once again! Go! Aquarion!

00:19:03.292 --> 00:19:05.417
Ahh...! I'm getting connected...

00:19:05.417 --> 00:19:08.667
I'm getting connected and
my world is expanding, too!

00:19:10.875 --> 00:19:14.000
So this is the real Gattai...

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.708
Andy?!

00:19:16.708 --> 00:19:19.958
See? Andy is with us, too. So, okay?

00:19:23.917 --> 00:19:28.917
I can't believe it...
After resisting each other so much...

00:19:28.917 --> 00:19:32.875
Could this be... Mikono's power, Fudo?!

00:19:32.875 --> 00:19:36.292
That's right. The power to connect.

00:19:36.292 --> 00:19:38.292
Power to connect...

00:19:43.458 --> 00:19:48.417
I'm being filled with the
remnants of Andy's heart...

00:19:51.375 --> 00:19:54.875
Aquarion Evol!

00:19:57.208 --> 00:20:02.542
Gattai is a magic born
from human relationships.

00:20:02.542 --> 00:20:06.333
I see... The Elements'
relationships with one another...

00:20:06.333 --> 00:20:09.250
...create new powers.

00:20:12.792 --> 00:20:14.833
Damn Mechanical Angel!

00:20:14.833 --> 00:20:16.875
Let's finish this at once!

00:20:16.875 --> 00:20:18.542
Unleash all weapons!

00:20:18.542 --> 00:20:22.000
I’ll fill the hole left by Andy!

00:20:23.917 --> 00:20:27.167
Absolute Clam!

00:20:35.833 --> 00:20:37.333
What?!

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.833
Wh-What?! What's going on?!

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:51.625
All the holes have been filled?!

00:20:51.625 --> 00:20:53.625
The machines won't last long like this!

00:20:56.208 --> 00:20:58.125
A-Amazing!

00:20:58.125 --> 00:21:00.958
So this is Mix's Element power...

00:21:00.958 --> 00:21:03.792
The fiercer the enemy's attacks are,

00:21:03.792 --> 00:21:06.542
the more the filled holes are likely to explode.

00:21:06.542 --> 00:21:08.125
The holes are being filled,

00:21:08.125 --> 00:21:11.333
and at the same time,
they're digging their own graves, huh?

00:21:11.333 --> 00:21:16.125
People come out of a hole
and go back to a hole.

00:21:16.125 --> 00:21:21.000
Alas, this is precisely the grave power of life!

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.750
Sir Jin!

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:32.667
Like I said...!

00:21:32.667 --> 00:21:36.542
I was just digging a garbage hole
because the headmaster asked me to!

00:21:36.542 --> 00:21:39.000
So I said, I'm sorry!

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.125
When I see a hole, I instinctively
get the urge to fill it!

00:21:42.125 --> 00:21:45.208
Looks like they get along
so well that they fight.

00:21:45.208 --> 00:21:46.750
It's thanks to you, Mikono.

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:47.750
What?

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:51.167
Your power, the "power
to connect," is incredible.

00:21:51.167 --> 00:21:54.667
Their attraction to each other was
somewhere within them from the start.

00:21:54.667 --> 00:21:58.208
My power is useless when
there's only one person.

00:21:58.208 --> 00:22:02.500
A power that's not just for one person,
but can be shared with others...

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:05.250
It's just like you, Mikono.

00:22:22.625 --> 00:22:24.000
Ow! Ow, ow, ow...

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:25.500
Amata!

00:22:27.458 --> 00:22:28.958
Amata!

00:22:32.375 --> 00:22:34.583
Romance is prohibited.

00:22:41.958 --> 00:22:44.708
So that's the island where Rare Iguras live, huh?

00:22:52.583 --> 00:22:58.042
<i>Kaze ni ubawareta wake janai</i>

00:22:58.042 --> 00:23:00.917
<i>Katamichi bun no yuuki de</i>

00:23:00.917 --> 00:23:08.708
<i>Bokura higeki o ukeireru</i>

00:23:08.708 --> 00:23:13.417
<i>Kokoro ga koko ni atta hazu no kuudou</i>

00:23:13.417 --> 00:23:16.000
<i>Motto boku ga ookikereba</i>

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:21.667
<i>Kimi o mirai o sukueta darou ka</i>

00:23:21.667 --> 00:23:29.000
<i>Taisetsu na hito o mamoru sube o</i>
<i>tatta hitotsu shika motanai</i>

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:35.833
<i>Sonna anata ga hagure tadayou sora</i>

00:23:35.833 --> 00:23:43.542
<i>Anata ijou no hito ni deaenai</i>

00:23:43.542 --> 00:23:50.000
<i>Tsuki ni aragau nagai furea</i>

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:56.542
<i>Hajimari mo sezu owaru monogatari</i>

00:23:56.542 --> 00:24:02.500
<i>Kizutsukiuru yawarakasa tojikometa senritsu</i>

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.542
<i>Kanaderu hodo utau hodo</i>

00:24:05.542 --> 00:24:11.042
<i>Kowareru hodo ni</i>

00:24:11.042 --> 00:24:17.958
<i>Anataga koishii</i>

00:24:20.750 --> 00:24:23.708
What?! No way! We're gonna
have another transfer student?!

00:24:23.708 --> 00:24:25.500
All right! I'm so looking forward to it...

00:24:25.500 --> 00:24:29.167
...since Amata's character makes it hard
to figure out if he's a top or a bottom.

00:24:30.208 --> 00:24:31.292
"Next Episode 'One-Eyed Transfer Student'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:31.292 --> 00:24:33.000
"Next Episode 'One-Eyed Transfer Student'"
"One-Eyed Transfer Student."
